        ("Which file mode raises FileNotFoundError when the file does not exist?", ["'w'", "'a'", "'r'", "'x'"], 2, "Mode 'r' can only open an existing file, while 'w' and 'x' create and 'a' creates the file if it is missing."),
        ("What does fh.write('abc') return when the file is opened in text mode?", ["None", "3", "'abc'", "True"], 1, "Text-mode write returns the number of characters written, which here is 3."),
