        ("What does app.dependency_overrides[get_db] = fake_get_db do?", ["Replaces the dependency, typically for tests", "Deletes the route from the app", "Overrides the OpenAPI document title", "Disables response validation"], 0, "dependency_overrides swaps the implementation behind a Depends dependency at runtime, the standard way to inject fakes in tests."),
